Subject: [PATCH 07/20] Plutonium: thread tags, groups and the Elsewhere list

Threads are tagged t3:thread/<id> and described to the browser as
groups. The Apps panel lists windows from other shells under
"Elsewhere"; opening one adds it to the thread.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
